# The build context is os/rootfs/packages-src/, the producer family directory,
# and this producer needs two things out of it: the shared copyright file and
# its own control template. Everything else -- the driver, the README, and every
# sibling producer that lands beside it -- is excluded, so an edit there does
# not invalidate this producer's context.
#
# The anchors themselves are not here and are not a context. They are GENERATED
# by the first stage of the Dockerfile, from the pinned Debian base, which is
# what keeps this repository from carrying 150 certificates it did not issue.
*
!copyright
!ca-trust/control/*.control
